    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end"><div><p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-600">Administración protegida</p><h1 class="mt-1 text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">Respaldos y seguridad</h1><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Continuidad operativa, auditoría, doble factor y monitoreo.</p></div><button type="button" wire:click="createBackup" wire:loading.attr="disabled" class="rounded-xl bg-brand-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-brand-700 disabled:opacity-60"><span wire:loading.remove wire:target="createBackup">Crear respaldo ahora</span><span wire:loading wire:target="createBackup">Creando y cifrando...</span></button></div>
